# Attention Assessment Feature Walkthrough

The **Attention Assessment** capability has been successfully implemented on the Hey Attrangi mental wellness platform.

## Changes Made

### 1. Backend: Attention Sentiment & Keyword Parsing

We modified the following files in `heyattrangi-huggingface`:

- **[signals.py](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/huggingface/hub/spaces--Heyattrangi-spaces--Bot-Heyattrangi-V4/snapshots/1248af6896eb13a36fd2adb2fe81b1717d61f698/core/signals.py)**: Added a semantic embedding prototype for `"attention"`: `"unable to focus, getting distracted, losing concentration, scatterbrained, brain fog"` and set the cosine similarity threshold to `0.50`.
- **[app.py](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/huggingface/hub/spaces--Heyattrangi-spaces--Bot-Heyattrangi-V4/snapshots/1248af6896eb13a36fd2adb2fe81b1717d61f698/app.py)**:
  - Updated [process_logic()](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/huggingface/hub/spaces--Heyattrangi-spaces--Bot-Heyattrangi-V4/snapshots/1248af6896eb13a36fd2adb2fe81b1717d61f698/app.py#427-965) to check if the attention score is custom-triggered.
  - Maintained a session-based list `triggered_actions` in memory to prevent the card from appearing repeatedly.
  - Returns the action payload containing:
    ```json
    "action": {
      "type": "ATTENTION_ASSESSMENT",
      "title": "Start Attention Assessment",
      "url": "/patient/library?tab=self_assignments"
    }
    ```
  - Forwarded the Action metadata field inside the Headless `/chat` POST endpoint JSON.

### 2. Frontend: API Spreader & Premium Assessment Card UI

We updated the next files in `heyattrangi-webapp`:

- **[TryPragyaChat.tsx](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/app-heyattrangi-main/app-heyattrangi-main/components/ai-bot/TryPragyaChat.tsx)**:
  - Imported Next.js `Link` component.
  - Expanded [ChatMessage](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/app-heyattrangi/app-heyattrangi/components/ai-bot/TryPragyaChat.tsx#8-18) types to support `action` payload.
  - Parsed the `action` field on message load response.
  - Rendered a custom-designed clinical assessment recommendation card with matching warm hues, a target identifier icon, descriptive text, and a focused Start button.
- **[page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/JAKKOJU/Downloads/app-heyattrangi-main/app-heyattrangi-main/app/patient/library/page.tsx)**:
  - Added a lightweight `useEffect`-based client search param parser on mounting so if `tab` parameter is present, it dynamically focuses on the corresponding tab view (like `self_assignments` showing ADHD ASRS assessment).

